  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Strongim Bisnis - support to the Private Sector in Solomon Islands - Phase 3 - 2023-2026</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The third phase of the Strongim-Bisnis investment is designed to support private sector development through systemic market-based interventions that catalyse business innovation, improve practices along value chains, and strengthen collaboration and increase women and people living with disability participation and empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
